.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd November 3, 2026
.Dt MK.PROG.MK 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mk.prog.mk
.Nd program module role: compiles and links one executable
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Fd .include <mk.prog.mk>
.Sh DESCRIPTION
A module directory
.Pa name.m
holding
.Pa src/
builds one program.
Set variables before the
.Ic .include ;
one set after it is not seen.
.Ss Variables
.Bl -tag -width "TOOLCHAINS"
.It Va PROG
The program's name.
Default: the directory's name without
.Pa .m .
.It Va LIBS
Libraries to link.
Link time only: headers come from
.Va PREREQS .
A library's own dependencies are added for you.
.It Va SRCS
Sources, relative to
.Pa src/ .
By default every
.Pa .c , .cc , .cpp , .cxx , .y
and
.Pa .l
file found there, leaving out hidden files.
.It Va LINK_CXX
.Cm yes :
link with
.Va CXX
although the sources are all C, for a module linking a static C++ library.
.It Va REQUIRES
See
.Xr mk.requires.mk 5 .
.It Va PLATFORMS , Va TOOLCHAINS , Va REASON. Ns Ar entry
See
.Xr mk.constraints.mk 5 .
.It Va DELAYLOAD. Ns Ar lib
See
.Xr mk.delayload.mk 5 .
.It Va TESTS_C , Va TESTS_CXX , Va TESTS_SH
See
.Xr mk.test.mk 5 .
.El
.Pp
.Va CFLAGS , CXXFLAGS , LDFLAGS , YFLAGS , LFLAGS , DEBUG_FLAGS
and the target selection are described in
.Xr mk.common.mk 5 .
.Ss Targets
.Bl -tag -width "copy-up"
.It Cm all
Compile and link into
.Pa build/ Ns Ar KEY Ns Pa /bin/ .
This is the default.
A library rebuilt elsewhere causes a relink, as does a change of flags.
.It Cm copy-up
Build, then copy the program to the framework.
.It Cm test
See
.Xr mk.test.mk 5 .
.It Cm clean
Remove this key's output; with
.Va TARGET=all ,
every key's.
.It Cm help
Print the current selection and the usual variables.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "build/KEY/bin/PROG"
.It Pa src/
sources
.It Pa include/
private headers
.It Pa mk/
hook files; see
.Xr mk.local.mk 5
.It Pa build/ Ns Ar KEY Ns Pa /bin/ Ns Va PROG
the program
.It Pa build/ Ns Ar KEY Ns Pa /obj/
objects and dependency files
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
PROG=viewer
LIBS=geo png
CFLAGS+=-DUSE_PNG
\&.include <mk.prog.mk>
.Ed
.Sh DIAGNOSTICS
.Bl -diag
.It error: cannot link Ar prog : prerequisite library Ar lib (from LIBS=) has not been built yet
No library of that name in the search directories, which are named.
.It error: cannot link Ar prog : library Ar lib is not built here
That library is excluded on this target; give this module the same
.Va PLATFORMS
or
.Va TOOLCHAINS .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr bmake-it 7 ,
.Xr mk.common.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.delayload.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.framework.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.lib.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.requires.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.test.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.tst.mk 5
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Sylvain Souche
